		{
			description: [
				"Prepare your LV Chemical Reactor and expand your production lines. These chapters suggest a factory development order; JEI shows the exact voltage and any earlier recipe route."
				"Keep fluid lines separate, label storage and check circuit settings, amounts and output space before starting a batch. Reuse useful byproducts."
				"Fluid tasks ask for a 1,000 mB sample through the quest system. The sample is consumed, so produce extra for your factory."
			]
